  "summary": "Hi there! My name’s Ash, I’m a full stack developer with over 4 years experience developing and maintaining Enterprise Java, web, and mobile applications.\n\nI’m proficient in Angular using Typescript/HTML/CSS, as well as other web development technologies like NPM, Capacitor, ElasticSearch, Nginx, and Karma/Jasmine. I’ve also spent time developing with Java and related frameworks such as Spring, EJB, REST APIs, and JavaPOS. \n\nAdditionally I possess ancillary skills like SQL, Docker, Linux, CLI, and hardware. Outside of work I’m usually working on some new Raspberry Pi project. Although when I’m not in front of a computer, I enjoy snuggling up with my cat and reading a good comic.",
